  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nBlack and white photography has always been my greatest love. When I was shooting on black and white film, there was no “one size fits all” solution. Different film emulsions respond to light and color tone differently, so I set out to create a collection of Flexible Picture Control recipes that replicate the unique looks of my favorite films. This recipe is designed to emulate the tonal reproduction curve of a classic British 400 ISO black and white film emulsion exposed at ISO 200 and “pull” developed to create optimum skin tones and smoother transitions.",
